<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>Improved Insectoids</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <success>Always</success>
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/MemeDef[defName="VME_InsectoidSupremacy"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: insectoid mastery -->
            <label>supremacía insectoide</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/PreceptDef[defName="VME_InsectMeatEating_Sacrilegious"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: sacrilegious -->
            <label>aborrecible</label>
          </value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>More Precepts</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <success>Always</success>
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/MemeDef[defName="VME_Nomad"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: wanderlust -->
            <label>nómada</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/MemeDef[defName="VME_Pacifist"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: nonaggression -->
            <label>pacifista</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/IssueDef[defName="VME_Violence"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: aggression -->
            <label>violencia</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/PreceptDef[defName="VME_Violence_Acceptable"]/description</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: Aggression is just a fact of life. -->
            <description>La violencia es solo un hecho de la vida.</description>
          </value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>Precepts and Memes</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <success>Always</success>
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/PreceptDef[defName="VME_Death_DontCare"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: extremely irrelevant -->
            <label>no importa</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/MemeDef[defName="VME_Trader"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <!-- EN: wealthy -->
            <label>comerciante</label>
          </value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>Odyssey</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
      <mods>
        <li>Vanilla Fishing Expanded</li>
      </mods>
      <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
        <success>Always</success>
        <operations>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <success>Always</success>
            <xpath>/Defs/IssueDef[defName="VME_FishingYield"]/label</xpath>
            <value>
              <!-- EN: fishing skill -->
              <label>habilidad de pesca</label>
            </value>
          </li>
          <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
            <success>Always</success>
            <xpath>/Defs/PreceptDef[defName="VME_Fishing_Adept"]/description</xpath>
            <value>
              <!-- EN: Our adoration for the water and all life within has led us to employ new and subtle techniques for catching as many fish as possible.\n\n&lt;color=#E5E54C&gt;Gameplay effect:&lt;/color&gt;\n - Adept fishermen will be able to catch additional fish from fishing zones. These &quot;adept fish&quot; will be caught 20% of the time in a stack of 10, increasing the overall yield of fishing. -->
              <description>Nuestra adoración por el agua y toda la vida en su interior nos ha llevado a emplear técnicas nuevas y sutiles para capturar tantos peces como sea posible.\n\n&lt;color=#E5E54C&gt;Efecto de juego:&lt;/color&gt;\n - Los pescadores adeptos podrán capturar peces adicionales en las zonas de pesca. Estos "peces adeptos" se capturarán el 20% de las veces en una pila de 10, aumentando el rendimiento general de la pesca.</description>
            </value>
          </li>
        </operations>
      </match>
    </match>
  </Operation>
</Patch>